{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - System - Session - Okta Admin Console Accessed",
	"Description": "Someone opened the Okta admin console. Compare the actor, the source address, and the geolocation against who is supposed to be administering the org; admin console access from an unexpected address or country is worth chasing even when the credentials were valid.\n\nEvent types: user.session.access_admin_app, plus any request whose URI is under /admin\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
